00:00:10.480 --> 00:00:12.080
because there is no police force there.

00:00:12.080 --> 00:00:14.660
I was terrified to go because I knew if I got shot or stabbed,

00:00:14.660 --> 00:00:16.200
and I have been assaulted, I've been

00:00:16.200 --> 00:00:18.600
mobbed and robbed in Austin, Texas by Antifa,

00:00:18.600 --> 00:00:20.719
that nobody would come to help me.

00:00:20.719 --> 00:00:22.879
So my plea to the entire administration,

00:00:22.879 --> 00:00:27.120
especially to the DOJ, is every single radical left winger

00:00:27.120 --> 00:00:29.600
who is in front of the ICE facility in Chicago,

00:00:29.600 --> 00:00:32.279
in New York, in Portland, please make sure

00:00:32.279 --> 00:00:34.040
that you use the full force of the law

00:00:34.040 --> 00:00:36.759
to come after each and every single one of them

00:00:36.759 --> 00:00:40.040
because it is us being soft on left wing violence that

00:00:40.040 --> 00:00:43.400
has fomented all of the terror that we

00:00:43.400 --> 00:00:44.759
have seen in this country.

00:00:44.759 --> 00:00:47.480
And it is the left wing getting away time and time

00:00:47.480 --> 00:00:50.560
again with assaulting law abiding American citizens that

00:00:50.560 --> 00:00:51.720
has led us to this place.

00:00:51.720 --> 00:00:55.240
So truly, to the Americans that I speak to on the ground,

00:00:55.240 --> 00:00:58.360
they feel completely abandoned by their state and local

00:00:58.360 --> 00:00:59.040
government.

00:00:59.040 --> 00:01:00.200
So please step in.

00:01:00.200 --> 00:01:02.439
We have Americans begging for the National Guard.

00:01:02.439 --> 00:01:05.639
And to the media over here, please report on the truth.

00:01:05.639 --> 00:01:07.040
Please do your jobs.

00:01:07.040 --> 00:01:08.080
I'm an American citizen.

00:01:08.080 --> 00:01:10.959
