00:01:10.959 --> 00:01:13.599
as American citizens who have an iPhone and the will

00:01:13.599 --> 00:01:15.040
to actually tell the truth.

00:01:15.040 --> 00:01:18.680
So please take your job seriously and tell the truth

00:01:18.680 --> 00:01:19.839
to the American people.

00:01:19.839 --> 00:01:22.260
And thank you for letting me be here on behalf of Charlie

00:01:22.260 --> 00:01:24.400
to continue his legacy of cleaning up the country.

00:01:24.400 --> 00:01:25.440
Thank you, Mr. President.

00:01:25.440 --> 00:01:26.320
Thank you very much.

00:01:26.320 --> 00:01:27.279
Appreciate it.

00:01:27.279 --> 00:01:29.160
Wow, you feel very strongly, I can see.

00:01:29.160 --> 00:01:29.639
I'm mad.

00:01:29.639 --> 00:01:31.720
I got beat up so many times, Mr. President.

00:01:31.720 --> 00:01:33.080
