00:01:53.040 --> 00:01:53.720
Fantastic.

00:01:53.720 --> 00:01:54.599
Thank you very much.

00:01:54.599 --> 00:01:55.839
Great, great job.

00:01:55.839 --> 00:01:57.360
Impassioned.

